    "立直麻将一般指日本麻将，是麻将规则的一个分支。": "Riichi Mahjong generally refers to Japanese mahjong, a branch of mahjong rules.",
    "GGHK 立直麻将规则书": "GGHK Riichi Mahjong Rulebook",
    "香港麻将协会发布的立直麻将规则书": "A Riichi Mahjong rulebook published by the Hong Kong Mahjong Association.",
    "青雀是由莫莫柴编写的一款麻雀规则，旨在寻求一种在传统麻将行牌规则框架内的做大、抢和、兜牌防守三者平衡的麻雀游戏，同时试图为各类和牌提供基于美感和难度评估的赋分参照。": "Qingque is a mahjong ruleset created by Momochai. Within the framework of traditional mahjong play, it seeks a balance among building high-value hands, winning quickly, and defensive tile holding, while assigning values to winning hands based on aesthetics and difficulty.",
    "青雀一页纸": "Qingque Quick Reference",
