    "尚未实装该规则，此处仅提供规则书查阅。": "This ruleset has not yet been implemented; its rulebook is provided here for reference only.",
    "十样锦麻将规则书": "Shiyangjin Mahjong Rulebook",
    "十样锦麻将规则说明。": "Rules for Shiyangjin Mahjong.",
    "本规则为根据《绘图麻雀牌谱》《想定宁波规则》等书籍文献资料汇总而成的，试图还原1920年代左右或以前的早期麻将样貌的麻将规则。相比现代规则，古典麻雀有番种体系简单、重刻杠幺九、未和牌家计分等特点，具有独特风味。": "This ruleset was compiled from books and historical sources such as Illustrated Mahjong Records and Proposed Ningbo Rules. It attempts to recreate mahjong as played around the 1920s or earlier. Compared with modern rules, Classical Mahjong has a simpler scoring-pattern system, places greater value on pungs and kongs of terminals and honors, and scores players who did not win, giving it a distinctive character.",
    "平台现行的古典麻将版本。": "The current Classical Mahjong rules used on this platform.",
