    "对局开始前服务器公布承诺值 = SHA256(主种子 + 盐值)，对局结束后公布主种子与盐值。 在此本地复现随机座位与每局配牌，验证服务器未中途更换种子。计算均在浏览器内完成。": "Before the game, the server publishes a commitment = SHA256(master seed + salt). After the game, it publishes the master seed and salt. Reproduce the seat assignment and each hand locally to verify that the server did not replace the seed during the game. All calculations run in your browser.",
    "赤宝牌（与对局设置一致）": "Red fives (match the game settings)",
    "对局局数": "Number of hands",
    "本场实际打的局数；立直 / 古典的连庄也算一局（局种子序号递增）": "The actual number of hands played. Dealer continuations in Riichi and Classical Mahjong also count as one hand because the hand-seed index advances.",
    "牌谱 player_entry_order 的顺序，留空则用 玩家1-4": "Use the order in the record’s player_entry_order. Leave blank to use Player 1–4.",
    "承诺值（选填）": "Commitment (optional)",
    "开始验证": "Verify",
    "对局结束时公布的随机主种子（十六进制或十进制）": "Master random seed published after the game (hexadecimal or decimal)",
