    "可直接粘贴游戏内复制的「承诺值：xxxx 盐值：xxxx」": "You can paste “Commitment: xxxx Salt: xxxx” copied from the game.",
    "随机种子验证 - salasasa.cn": "Random Seed Verification - salasasa.cn",
    "手牌 0/13 或 14": "Hand 0/13 or 14",
    "0/13 或 14": "0/13 or 14",
    "牌谱格式转换": "Game Record Converter",
    "浏览器本地转换，支持国标：雀渣 ↔ salasasa ↔ Botzone；日麻：salasasa ↔ MJAI。 反向重建（尤其 Botzone→salasasa、salasasa→雀渣）在隐藏信息处为近似，请核对后再用于训练。": "Conversion runs locally in your browser. MCR: Quezha ↔ salasasa ↔ Botzone. Riichi: salasasa ↔ MJAI. Reverse reconstruction, especially Botzone → salasasa and salasasa → Quezha, approximates hidden information. Check the result before using it for training.",
    "转换方向": "Conversion direction",
    "雀渣 → salasasa（国标）": "Quezha → salasasa (MCR)",
    "salasasa → 雀渣（国标）": "salasasa → Quezha (MCR)",
