    "字段 / 内容\t结果\t怎么处理\t例子": "Field / content\tResult\tProcessing\tExample",
    "手牌 / 牌山 / 摸切吃碰杠和\t完整\t按雀渣网页脚本位域原样解码，不猜测。": "Hand / wall / draw, discard, chow, pung, kong, win\tComplete\tDecoded directly from the Quezha web script bit fields without inference.",
    "摸 1 万 → [\"d\", 11]；手切 3 饼 → [\"c\", 23, \"F\"]": "Draw 1 Characters → [\"d\", 11]; discard 3 Dots from hand → [\"c\", 23, \"F\"]",
    "番种 y → hu_fan\t完整\t用网页 FAN[] 表把番种编号还原成中文名。": "Pattern y → hu_fan\tComplete\tUses the page’s FAN[] table to restore pattern IDs to names.",
    "索引 51 → \"混一色\"；花牌×2 → \"花牌*2\"": "Index 51 → \"Half Flush\"; two flowers → \"Flower Tiles*2\"",
    "p0_uid … p3_uid\t近似\t雀渣玩家 id 是短字符串，salasasa 要整数，用字符串稳定哈希生成占位 uid。": "p0_uid … p3_uid\tApproximate\tQuezha player IDs are short strings, while salasasa requires integers. A stable string hash generates placeholder UIDs.",
