    "多规则同台：国标、立直、青雀、四川麻将、长沙麻将等，规则书与牌例可在站内查阅。": "Multiple rules on one platform: MCR, Riichi, Qingque, Sichuan Mahjong, Changsha Mahjong, and more. Rulebooks and hand examples are available on the site.",
    "开源可自建：项目遵循 MIT，可自行部署服务器；公共平台若因攻击等原因无法维持，规则制定者仍可自建服务。": "Open source and self-hostable: the project uses the MIT License and can be deployed on your own server. If the public platform becomes unavailable, ruleset creators can still host their own service.",
    "当前默认配置：": "Current defaults:",
    "鸣牌保护时间：1.3s": "Call protection: 1.3 s",
    "第一追赶时间：0.7s": "First catch-up delay: 0.7 s",
    "第二追赶时间：0.5s": "Second catch-up delay: 0.5 s",
    "房间配置中可开关战术鸣牌。关闭时走「等待最高优先级操作执行完成」的原始流程。": "Tactical calls can be enabled or disabled in the room settings. When disabled, the original flow waits for the highest-priority action to finish.",
    "入口模式：": "Modes:",
    "申请字段说明：": "Application fields:",
    "一条规则的执行逻辑由三部分组成：": "A ruleset consists of three parts:",
    "申请时请附上：": "Include the following with your application:",
    "数字 UID": "Numeric UID",
    "网麻战绩（可选）": "Online mahjong results (optional)",
    "赞助可联系群主Xe，赞助者在数据站可以额外获得下载牌谱的限额，也可以提前准入中级场，赞助100元添加鸣谢名单": "Contact group owner Xe to sponsor the project. Sponsors can receive an additional game-record download quota on the data site and can also gain early access to intermediate rooms. A CNY 100 sponsorship adds you to the acknowledgements.",
    "■ 个人训练、创建房间、匹配": "■ Solo training, rooms, and matchmaking",
