    "规则集：国标+立直、BO5、限时60s、8次猜番机会、计入排行": "Rules: MCR + Riichi, best of 5, 60-second limit, 8 guesses, ranked.",
    "规则集：立直、BO5、限时60s、8次猜番机会、计入排行": "Rules: Riichi, best of 5, 60-second limit, 8 guesses, ranked.",
    "匹配队列（0 人）": "Matchmaking queue (0 players)",
