    "Salasasa 平台赛事规约": "Salasasa Event Rules",
    "赛事的组织、奖金等各项成本开支不得低于报名费的 80%，如赛事奖励中提供更上级比赛名额或特殊奖励的，可以进行独立核算。": "At least 80% of entry fees must be spent on event organization, prizes, and other event costs. Qualification places for higher-level events and other special prizes may be accounted for separately.",
    "收取报名费的赛事必须明确规定赛事规则与奖励方式；该内容同样受赛事介绍中平台可能对赛制争端进行介入的声明约束。": "Events that charge an entry fee must clearly state their rules and prizes. The platform may intervene in disputes as described in the event information requirements below.",
    "涉及烟、酒、槟榔等成瘾品赞助的赛事，须提前联系平台管理员后再申报。": "For events sponsored by tobacco, alcohol, betel nut, or other addictive products, contact a platform administrator before applying.",
    "赛事名称必须提交中文、英文或其他语言的完整赛事全称，不得使用简写、表述不清或者有公共性质的赛事名称；错误案例：国标麻将比赛、FST杯；正确案例：第一届神秘嘉宾杯国标麻将比赛、咕咕嘎嘎国标麻将群内赛。": "Enter the complete event name in Chinese, English, or another language. Do not use abbreviations, unclear wording, or a generic public name. Invalid examples: MCR Mahjong Tournament, FST Cup. Valid examples: 1st Mystery Guest Cup MCR Mahjong Tournament, Gugu Gaga MCR Mahjong Group Tournament.",
    "拟定开始时间 / 拟定结束时间": "Planned Start / Planned End",
    "拟定开始时间": "Planned start date",
    "至": "to",
    "拟定结束时间（可选）": "Planned end date (optional)",
    "拟定开始时间和结束时间只是申请的开启赛事和关闭赛事的大致时间范围，赛事的开启与关闭将由比赛管理员自行决定；\n如果是长期的月赛或者季度赛，可以不设截止时间或连续申报比赛，在确定拟定日期以后也可以随时进行更改。": "The planned dates are only an approximate window. Event administrators decide when the event actually starts and ends.\nLong-running monthly or quarterly events may omit an end date or submit consecutive applications. Planned dates may be changed later.",
    "赛事介绍中必须包含明确的报名联系方式，对于实际赛程这里可以不予规定、即使予以规定，后期也可以进行更改。但是，如果赛事在实际赛程中规定了某些赛事规则或者奖励方式但未达成，或者在临时更改赛制以后出现了争议或争端，平台也会一定程度上对赛事进行一些介入监管；包括且不限于，批评、取消办赛资格、封禁个别账户等惩罚，请务必注意这一点。": "The event description must provide clear registration contact details. The schedule may be omitted or changed later. If stated rules or prizes are not honored, or last-minute format changes cause a dispute, the platform may intervene with measures including warnings, revocation of organizer privileges, or account bans.",
    "给予管理员的审核意见，或者不希望在赛事介绍中展示、但是需要预先告知的特殊声明。": "Notes for the reviewing administrator, or special disclosures that must be provided in advance but should not appear in the public event description.",
    "修改并重新提交": "Edit and Resubmit",
    "保存申请修改": "Save Changes",
    "取消修改": "Cancel Editing",
    "查看办赛申请与已注册赛事；点击「管理」在下方展开管理面板。": "View event applications and registered events. Select Manage to open the management panel below.",
    "查看基地申请与已注册基地；点击「管理」在下方展开管理面板。": "View base applications and registered bases. Select Manage to open the management panel below.",
    "已注册基地": "Registered Bases",
    "暂无管理中的基地": "No managed bases",
    "Salasasa 平台基地规约": "Salasasa Base Rules",
    "创建基地后，玩家可以在基地中进行对局，同时管理员对对局状态、玩家牌谱与数据统计均有管理权能，如果有长期月赛或者其他非杯赛的不定期活动，使用基地来创建也是可以的。": "After a base is created, players can play there. Administrators manage games, records, and statistics. Long-running monthly events or other non-cup activities may also be hosted as a base.",
    "如果社团活动涉及烟、酒、槟榔等成瘾品赞助的相关内容，请在申请基地的介绍或者发布相关公告之前联系平台管理员。": "If club activities involve sponsorship related to tobacco, alcohol, betel nut, or other addictive products, contact a platform administrator before putting this in the base application or posting related announcements.",
    "基地名称必须提交中文、英文或其他语言的完整赛事全称，不得使用简写、表述不清或者有公共性质的基地名称；错误案例：「国标麻将基地」、「salasasa麻将群」、「麻将活动室」等。": "Enter the complete base name in Chinese, English, or another language. Do not use abbreviations, unclear wording, or a generic public name. Invalid examples: “MCR Mahjong Base”, “salasasa mahjong group”, “Mahjong activity room”.",
    "对基地的持续时间不设限制，时间设置由基地管理员自行决定。": "There is no limit on how long a base may last. Timing is decided by the base administrator.",
    "基地介绍中必须包含基地/社团的简单介绍，不得留空，如果不希望对外发展社团成员，可以不留下联系方式。": "The description must include a brief introduction of the base or club and cannot be empty. If you do not wish to recruit members publicly, you may omit contact details.",
    "给予管理员的审核意见，或者不希望在公开介绍中展示、但是需要预先告知的特殊声明。": "Notes for the reviewing administrator, or special disclosures that must be provided in advance but should not appear in the public description.",
    "追加备注": "Add a note",
    "可追加一条新备注，将写入双方往来记录": "Optional. A new note will be appended to the two-way history.",
    "给予管理员的说明，或不希望在公开介绍中展示、但需预先告知的特殊声明。修改申请、保存修改、重新提交时填写的内容会按时间追加到双方往来备注栏。": "Notes for the reviewing administrator, or special disclosures that should be provided in advance but not shown publicly. Notes added when editing, saving, or resubmitting are appended to the two-way history in order.",
    "赛事负责人": "Event organizer",
    "基地负责人": "Base organizer",
