    "第三名扣除“段位均失 PT × 0.3 × 局制系数”，第四名扣除“段位均失 PT × 0.7 × 局制系数”。东风 0.49、半庄 0.7、全庄 1。": "Third place loses rank loss base × 0.3 × format coefficient; fourth place loses rank loss base × 0.7 × format coefficient. East round 0.49, half game 0.7, four rounds 1.",
