    "国标十六张：扩展规则与牌例": "16-tile MCR: extended rules and examples",
    "以新编 MCR 为底本的本站十六张扩展，含逐番适用表与五面子计分补则。": "This platform’s 16-tile extension of revised MCR, with a pattern applicability table and additional scoring rules for five melds.",
    "四人立直麻将，支持多种规则预设及役种、计分和流局设置": "Four-player Riichi mahjong, with multiple rule presets and settings for yaku, scoring and drawn hands.",
    "香港麻将协会发布的立直麻将规则书。": "Riichi mahjong rulebook published by the Hong Kong Mahjong Association.",
    "全国雀庄公式战手册 v1.0": "Nationwide Mahjong Parlor Official Match Handbook v1.0",
    "雀庄公式战预设所依据的公开手册。": "Public handbook on which the mahjong parlor official match preset is based.",
    "查看公开手册": "Read public handbook",
    "台湾麻将：使用144张牌与16张手牌，按台计分，支持公开报听、食替限制与八仙过海等规则。具体流程与台表可在馆规设置中选择。": "Taiwanese mahjong uses 144 tiles and a 16-tile hand, with scoring in tai. It supports public ready-hand declarations, restrictions on swap-calling and the Eight Immortals Crossing the Sea rule. The procedures and tai table can be selected in the house-rule settings.",
    "四川麻将（血战到底）": "Sichuan Mahjong (Blood Battle)",
    "长沙麻将经典双鸟规则：108张数牌，可吃上家牌，258将小胡，大胡可叠加，和牌后翻两只鸟并按座位中鸟加倍。": "Classic two-bird Changsha rules: 108 suited tiles; Chow is allowed from the player on the left. A small win requires a pair of 2s, 5s or 8s, while big-win patterns can be combined. After a win, two bird tiles are revealed, and points are doubled for bird hits according to seat position.",
    "本平台长沙麻将规则说明。": "Changsha mahjong rules used on this platform.",
    "也叫 MCR、中国麻将竞赛规则": "Also known as MCR or Chinese Official Mahjong",
    "计分": "Scoring",
    "← 馆藏目录": "← Library catalogue",
