    "多版／平台伞称（1998原本另列）": "Multiple editions / platform umbrella term (1998 original listed separately)",
    "国标麻将规则资料，包含 Natsuki 编著的《新编 MCR》及各改编版本规则书。": "MCR rule materials, including Natsuki’s revised MCR rulebook and rulebooks for adapted versions.",
    "国标是多版规则及平台实现的伞称。1998原本题署7月、9月初版；WMO 2006和赛事补充须另看具名版本。平台使用的新编MCR不应与1998全文等同，原目录11月出台说已按原书更正。": "MCR is an umbrella term covering several rule editions and platform implementations. The 1998 original is dated July, with its first printing in September. The WMO 2006 rules and tournament supplements are separate named editions. The revised MCR rulebook used by this platform is not identical to the full 1998 text. The catalogue’s former November publication date has been corrected against the original book.",
