    "手牌牌面背景：用于在手牌牌面使用透明通道的情况下替换背景，默认尺寸 272*389。\n手牌牌背：用于在里宝牌区或者2D展示中显示牌背\n3D牌面背景：用于在3D卡牌的正面叠底在3D花纹下显示\n上传成对 zip格式：hand-back.png + hand-bg.png。": "Hand background: replaces the background behind transparent hand faces. Default size: 272 × 389.\nHand back: used for ura-dora and 2D tile backs.\n3D face background: sits behind the pattern on the front of 3D tiles.\nPaired ZIP format: hand-back.png + hand-bg.png.",
