    "C 为负数时是保护奖励；PT 保留两位小数。十段固定 100/100 PT，每场变动为 0。": "A negative C is a protection bonus. PT uses two decimal places. 10 Dan is fixed at 100/100 PT with no per-game change.",
    "立直 · 段位升降与扣分表": "Riichi · Promotion, demotion & deductions",
    "各名次扣相同的 C；东风整体乘 0.7，负数为保护奖励。特许可突破最低段位；— 为禁入场次。": "Every place deducts the same C. East rounds multiply the total by 0.7. Negative C gives protection. Special eligibility may bypass the minimum rank; — means the tier is unavailable.",
