    "01 / 认识一副牌": "01 / Meet the tiles",
    "一副国标麻将，一共 144 张": "An MCR set contains 144 tiles",
    "把牌先分成三类：数牌、字牌、花牌。\n不用急着记番种，今天先认清牌面。": "Start with three groups: suits, honors and flowers.\nNo need to memorize scoring patterns yet; first, learn the tile faces.",
