    "基地申请预览": "Club application preview",
    "返回修改": "Back to edit",
    "<b>青雀 · 局均素点 Elo</b>\n初始 R = 1500；全庄与无固定时限共用积分。\nN = 实际完成局数（包含流局），Y = 累计净素点。\n局均 A = Y / N；桌均 M = 四人 R 的平均值。\n预期局均 = (自己 R - M) / 32\n普通变化 = 32N / (N + 1584) × (A - 预期局均)\n不按名次计分，不设涨跌硬上限。\n保护系数 K = 3200N / (N + 1584)\nT = max(0, 1500 - M)\nE = 1 / (1 + 10^((对手 R - 自己 R) / 2400))\nE' = 1 / (1 + 10^((对手 R + T - 自己 R) / 2400))\n指数限制在 -16 至 16；合计为三个对手之和。\n保护奖励 = (K / 3) × 合计(E - E')\n新 R = 原 R + 普通变化 + 保护奖励。\n普通变化按分币分配余差保持零和，保护另取两位。\n同为1500分、16局：净赢800加16，1600加32。\n未完成局不计入；零完成局不结算。": "<b>Qingque · Per-hand Raw-score Elo</b>\nStarting R = 1500. Full games and unlimited games share one rating.\nN = completed hands (including draws); Y = net raw score.\nAverage A = Y / N; table average M = average R of four players.\nExpected average = (own R - M) / 32\nNormal change = 32N / (N + 1584) × (A - expected average)\nNo placement scoring or hard change limit.\nProtection factor K = 3200N / (N + 1584)\nT = max(0, 1500 - M)\nE = 1 / (1 + 10^((opponent R - own R) / 2400))\nE' = 1 / (1 + 10^((opponent R + T - own R) / 2400))\nExponents are clamped to -16…16. Sums cover the three opponents.\nProtection bonus = (K / 3) × sum(E - E')\nNew R = old R + normal change + protection bonus.\nNormal changes allocate rounding remainders in cents to keep a zero sum; protection is rounded separately to two decimals.\nAt equal R 1500 over 16 hands: net +800 gives +16; +1600 gives +32.\nUnfinished hands do not count. No settlement if zero hands complete.",
    "麻雀教室": "Mahjong Classroom",
