    "第一组为明杠，第二组为暗杠": "The first set is a melded kong and the second is concealed.",
    "门清限定。\n整理阶段，当任何一家同时符合以下条件，可宣布立直并横置舍牌：\n- 门清听牌\n- 牌墙不计王牌还有剩余张数\n立直后和了可得一番。": "Concealed only.\nBefore discarding, a player may declare riichi and turn the discard sideways if:\n- Their concealed hand is ready.\n- The live wall still contains tiles, excluding the dead wall.\nWinning after riichi is worth 1 han.",
    "门前清；已宣告立直": "Concealed hand; riichi declared.",
    "门清限定。立直后第一巡内和牌，若中途有人鸣牌或暗杠，便不成立。": "Concealed only. Win within the first turn after declaring riichi. Any intervening call or concealed kong cancels this yaku.",
    "门前清自摸和": "Concealed Self-Draw",
    "门清限定。门前清的自摸和牌。": "Concealed only. Win a concealed hand by self-draw.",
    "门前清；自摸": "Concealed hand; self-draw.",
    "门清限定。和牌时，和牌没有任何额外的「符」，自摸/门前荣和符例外。即：四面子全为顺子。必须为两面听牌。雀头不能是役牌，但可为客风字牌。": "Concealed only. The hand has no additional fu, apart from self-draw or concealed-ron fu: four sequences, a two-sided wait and a pair that is not a value honor. A non-value wind pair is allowed.",
    "门前清；两面听牌": "Concealed hand; two-sided wait.",
    "断幺九": "All Simples",
    "和牌时，和牌没有任何么九牌，么九牌包括一、九的数牌及所有字牌。": "The winning hand contains no terminals or honors. Terminals are the 1 and 9 of each suit.",
    "一杯口": "Pure Double Sequence",
    "门清限定。和牌时，手牌有两个相同的顺子。": "Concealed only. The hand contains two identical sequences.",
    "役牌": "Value Honors",
    "有一个场风、自风或三元牌（役牌）的刻子。场风和自风可以叠加计算。": "A triplet of the round wind, seat wind or a dragon. Round-wind and seat-wind awards may both apply.",
    "杠后补牌马上自摸。": "Win immediately on the replacement draw after a kong.",
    "第一组为杠；末张为杠后补牌": "The first set is a kong; the last tile is its replacement draw.",
    "他家加杠的牌正好是自己和了的牌。十三么九无特权，不可抢暗杠。": "Win on another player's added-kong tile. Thirteen Orphans receives no exception: a concealed kong cannot be robbed.",
    "末张为他家加杠的牌": "The last tile is another player's added-kong tile.",
    "自摸王牌前的最后一张牌和了。杠尾的牌不算在内。": "Win on the final live-wall draw before the dead wall. A kong replacement tile does not count.",
