    "和牌仅由连续的某两种序数的序数牌组成。": "The hand contains only two consecutive numbered ranks.",
    "三聚": "Three-Number Range",
    "和牌仅由连续的某三种序数的序数牌组成，其中可以缺少部分序数。": "All numbered ranks lie within a range of three consecutive numbers; some may be absent.",
    "四聚": "Four-Number Range",
    "和牌仅由连续的某四种序数的序数牌组成，其中可以缺少部分序数。": "All numbered ranks lie within a range of four consecutive numbers; some may be absent.",
    "连数": "Consecutive Numbers",
    "和牌仅由序数牌组成，含且仅含连续的某几种序数，且任意两组牌（对子、顺子或刻子）之间都没有重复序数。": "A numbered-only hand using a consecutive range of ranks, with no rank repeated between any two sets (pairs, sequences or triplets).",
    "间数": "Equally Spaced Numbers",
    "和牌仅由不连续但间隔相同的序数的序数牌组成，其中可以缺少部分序数，但至少要有三种序数。": "A numbered-only hand with nonconsecutive, equally spaced ranks. Some ranks may be absent, but at least three distinct ranks are required.",
    "镜数": "Mirrored Numbers",
    "仅由序数牌组成的和牌，其中每个花色中的牌张组合关于同一个序数对称。即，存在一整数q，使得将和牌的某个拆解方式中的每个部分的序数关于q镜像后，仍是原来的拆解方式。此处面子的明与暗，刻子是否成杠均不作区分。": "A numbered-only hand whose sets in every suit are symmetric about the same integer q. Reflecting every part of one valid decomposition about q must reproduce that decomposition. Open and concealed sets are equivalent; triplets and kongs are equivalent.",
    "映数": "Reflected Suits",
    "仅由序数牌组成的和牌，其中一种花色中的牌张组合关于一个序数对称，另两种花色互为关于同一序数的镜像。即，存在一整数q，使得将和牌的某个拆解方式中的每个部分的序数关于q镜像后，交换两种花色，仍是原来的拆解方式。此处面子的明与暗，刻子是否成杠均不作区分。": "A numbered-only hand with one suit symmetric about an integer q and the other two suits reflecting each other about q. Reflect all parts of one valid decomposition, then swap those two suits: the decomposition must remain unchanged. Ignore open/concealed distinctions and treat triplets and kongs alike.",
    "满庭芳": "Pair Number Throughout",
    "和牌仅由序数牌组成，其中每个面子均包含雀头的序数。": "A numbered-only hand in which every set contains the rank of the pair.",
