    " · 番种记录": " · Fan records",
    "日汇总截止 ": "Daily summary through ",
    "平台累计\n按当前规则及场次读取公开牌谱统计，对局按 game_id 去重。全场次含匹配、自定义和赛事；四张场次卡始终展示当前规则的累计数量。\n\n匹配场行为数据\n累计手数为全桌手数；平均和牌 = 总和牌番值 ÷ 和牌次数；自摸占和牌 = 自摸次数 ÷ 和牌次数。不展示个人胜率和个人顺位。\n\n每日对局量\n时间窗口只作用于日汇总，不改变累计指标与最近牌谱。统计日以北京时间 04:00 切日，截止最近已完成聚合日。缺少记录的日期留空，不补零。\n\n场次与局制\n初级、中级、高级、自定义的累计计数来自网站首页的原始牌谱归口接口。自定义部分缺少完整行为指标，只展示已提供的对局计数。\n\n最近对局\n全场次时展示匹配场公共牌谱，可按等级场筛选、翻页并查看同桌结算。赛事单独查询；现有接口未提供自定义房间公共牌谱列表。\n\n番种记录\n累计出现次数可重复，不是互斥占比。所选场次无支持时显示不可用。": "Platform totals\nPublic replay statistics for the selected rule and venue, deduplicated by game_id. All venues includes matchmaking, custom rooms and events. The four venue cards always show cumulative totals for the selected rule.\n\nMatchmaking behavior\nHand count covers the whole table. Average winning fan = total winning fan / wins. Self-draw share = self-draws / wins. These are not personal win rates or placements.\n\nDaily matches\nThe date range applies only to daily summaries, not cumulative metrics or recent replays. Days roll over at 04:00 Beijing time, through the latest completed aggregation day. Missing dates remain blank, not zero.\n\nVenues and formats\nBeginner, Intermediate, Advanced and Custom totals come from the website's original replay aggregation API. Custom rooms lack complete behavior metrics, so only available match totals are shown.\n\nRecent matches\nAll venues shows public matchmaking replays, with tier filters, pagination and table results. Events are queried separately; the current API provides no public custom-room replay list.\n\nFan records\nCumulative occurrences may overlap; they are not exclusive shares. Unsupported venue selections are shown as unavailable.",
    "符": "fu",
    "台": "tai",
    "点": "points",
    " 局": " hands",
    "已解析 ": "Parsed ",
    " 场": " matches",
    "本规则暂未提供逐局统计": "Hand-by-hand statistics are not yet available for this rule",
    "统计范围\n所选规则、房间类型与日期同时作用于战绩和对局列表。\n\n和牌率 / 放铳率\n个人和牌次数 / 放铳次数 ÷ 参与的手数。\n\n自摸占和牌\n自摸次数 ÷ 和牌次数；不是每手自摸率。\n\n副露率\n个人副露手数 ÷ 参与的手数。\n\n平均顺位\n各顺位场次 × 顺位之和 ÷ 总场次。\n\n番种记录\n记录累计出现次数，可重复计数，不是互斥占比。\n\n近期走势\n最近最多 20 场，按时间从旧到新。缺少明细的指标显示“—”。": "Scope\nThe selected rule, room type and dates apply to both results and the match list.\n\nWin rate / Deal-in rate\nPersonal wins or deal-ins divided by hands played.\n\nSelf-draw share\nSelf-draws divided by wins, not by all hands.\n\nCall rate\nHands with personal calls divided by hands played.\n\nAverage placement\nThe sum of each placement multiplied by its match count, divided by total matches.\n\nFan records\nCumulative occurrences may overlap; they are not exclusive shares.\n\nRecent trend\nUp to 20 matches, oldest to newest. Missing details are shown as —.",
