    "四人真人匹配场每完成一小局，注册玩家获得 0.10 萨拉币（含连庄）": "Registered players earn 0.10 sala coins per completed hand in four-player human matchmaking, including repeats.",
    "在匹配对局中每完成一小局，获得0.05个萨拉币，例如国标麻将全庄战一共16小局，对局结束后获得0.8萨拉币。": "Earn 0.05 sala coins for each completed hand in matchmaking. An MCR Four Rounds match has 16 hands and awards 0.8 sala coins at the end.",
