    "等待下一位玩家摸牌": "Waiting for the next player to draw",
    "真实时间仅支持川麻复式": "Real-time responses are available only in duplicate Sichuan games.",
    "第二等待时间必须为3、5、8、10、15或20秒": "The secondary wait must be 3, 5, 8, 10, 15, or 20 seconds.",
    "真实时间：其他玩家出牌后，如果下一位应由你摸牌，碰、明杠或和牌使用正常局时与步时；否则使用第二等待时间。第二等待时间结束后，牌局不再专门等待你，但本张弃牌尚未处理完时，仍可操作。第二等待时间也用于战术鸣牌的抢断询问。血战有人和牌退场后，按仍在行牌的顺序判断。": "After a discard, the next player due to draw uses the normal turn time and round reserve for pung, exposed kong, or win decisions. Other players use the secondary wait. When it expires, play no longer waits specifically for you, but you can still respond until the discard is resolved. Tactical claim rechecks use the same duration. In Blood Battle, turn order skips players who have already won.",
    "非下一位摸牌者的首次响应等待与战术鸣牌抢断询问共用此时长，不扣局时。关闭真实时间会保留所选秒数，战术鸣牌开启时继续使用。首次等待结束仍可操作；抢断询问到期后执行已确定的动作。": "This duration is shared by the initial response wait for players who are not next to draw and tactical claim rechecks. It does not consume the round reserve. Turning off real-time responses preserves the selected duration for tactical claims. Initial expiry keeps responses available; recheck expiry resolves the pending claim.",
