    "在 Salasasa 免费在线玩国标麻将 MCR，支持自动算番、段位匹配和牌谱复盘。浏览器 2D 无需下载，另有多规则客户端与麻将学习工具。": "Play MCR Mahjong online for free on Salasasa, with automatic scoring, ranked matchmaking, and replay review. The browser 2D version needs no download; a multi-rule client and Mahjong learning tools are also available.",
    "免费在线玩国标麻将 MCR | Salasasa": "Play MCR Mahjong Online Free | Salasasa",
    "在浏览器中免费进行国标麻将 MCR 对局，支持自动算番、段位匹配与牌谱复盘，界面提供简繁中文、英语、日语和法语。": "Play MCR Mahjong for free in your browser, with automatic scoring, ranked matchmaking, and replay review. The interface is available in Simplified and Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, and French.",
