    "136张无花牌，0翻可和；吃碰明杠后仅可自摸，打出混儿后本局不可和牌。庄家和牌连庄，其余轮庄。": "136 tiles without flowers; 0-fan wins are allowed. After a chow, pung, or exposed kong, only self-draw wins are allowed. Discarding a joker prevents winning that hand. The dealer repeats after winning; otherwise, dealership rotates.",
    "可选规则变体（默认关闭）": "Optional rule variants (off by default)",
    "每张不按本体使用的混儿减1翻，最低保留1翻；原本0翻的和牌仍按0翻结算。": "Deduct 1 fan for each joker not used as its own tile, retaining at least 1 fan. Hands originally worth 0 fan are still scored at 0 fan.",
