    "特殊加杠": "Added special kong",
    "MIL 2024：136张、十三张手牌，三门带幺九，可吃碰杠和报听。一条仅可在特殊杠中代牌；报听后看宝，六番封顶。三张特殊杠首次不补牌，以后每加一张补一张。": "MIL 2024: 136 tiles and a 13-tile hand; all three suits and terminals or honors are required. Chows, pungs, kongs, and ready declarations are allowed. One Bamboo substitutes only in special kongs. View the treasure after declaring ready; scoring is capped at 6 fan. No replacement tile is drawn for the initial three-tile special kong; each subsequent added tile grants one replacement.",
    "有效申请后可在5秒内以更高优先级抢断；机器人入座自动关闭": "A higher-priority claim can interrupt within 5 seconds of a valid claim. Automatically disabled when a bot takes a seat.",
