    "开杠后按骰子位置公开补牌；卡摸仅限制小胡点和。封顶按每名和牌者、每名付款者计算，同批多次和牌累计计入封顶。": "After a kong, replacement tiles are revealed at the dice-indicated position. The draw restriction only limits small wins by discard. The cap applies to each winner–payer pair; multiple wins in the same batch count cumulatively toward the cap.",
    "开局有2秒可选择全桌不换；换完一轮后可选择再换一轮，最多两轮。每轮选六张、最多两种花色；三种花色失去和牌资格。固定四张开杠、双鸟、小胡2分、大胡8分起、不封顶。": "At the start, there are 2 seconds to opt out of exchanges for the whole table. After one exchange, another may be chosen, up to two rounds. Select six tiles of at most two suits each round; using three suits forfeits the right to win. Fixed settings: four kong replacement tiles, two birds, 2 points for small wins, big wins from 8 points, and no cap.",
