    "起始与返点均为40000点，顺位点为0；每副144张，包含8张不同赖子。两副牌组交替使用。": "Starting and return scores are both 40000 points, with no placement points. Each 144-tile set contains 8 different jokers. Two tile sets are used alternately.",
    "阅读夺彩麻将规则书与赖子图鉴": "Read the Duocai Mahjong rulebook and joker guide",
    "清空全部": "Clear all",
    "四家均预置 13 张手牌、8 张固定牌墙，另设 24 张公共牌墙。庄家开牌首摸取自固定墙；一家摸空后，剩余固定牌按东南西北接到公共墙前。": "Each player starts with 13 hand tiles and an 8-tile fixed wall, plus a shared wall of 24 tiles. The dealer's first draw comes from their fixed wall. When one player's wall runs out, the remaining fixed walls are placed before the shared wall in East–South–West–North order.",
    "四家均预置 13 张手牌、14 张个人牌墙。庄家开牌首摸取自个人牌墙。无公共牌墙，不预先把庄家第一张摸牌放入手牌。": "Each player starts with 13 hand tiles and a 14-tile personal wall. The dealer's first draw comes from their personal wall. There is no shared wall, and the dealer's first draw is not placed in the starting hand.",
