    "只允许碰彩虹，不允许普通碰牌。每位玩家每局最多补牌两次。无色牌可组成对子或同色顺子，不能组成刻子或彩虹。": "Only rainbow pungs are allowed; ordinary pungs are not. Each player may draw replacement tiles at most twice per hand. Colorless tiles can form pairs or same-color chows, but not pungs or rainbows.",
