    "红中替代：": "Red Dragon substitutions:",
    "MIL 2024：112张、十三张手牌，红中为万能牌，仅可自摸；可碰杠，不吃。最高四番，和牌后扎两鸟，流局退杠。": "MIL 2024: 112 tiles and 13-tile hands. Red Dragons are jokers; wins are by self-draw only. Pungs and kongs are allowed, but chows are not. The cap is 4 fan. Draw two birds after winning; kong payments are refunded on a draw.",
    "阅读 MIL 红中规则书": "Read the MIL Red Dragon rulebook",
    "九江麻将是九江地区一个没落的麻将规则，目前九江地区通行红中麻将，本规则是芋蔗凭借小时候的记忆和一定程度上的改良复现的一种失传规则，如发现任何问题或者能够提供九江麻将的资料的玩家可以联系Q2264033554": "Jiujiang Mahjong is a declining local rule set; Red Dragon Mahjong is now common in Jiujiang. Yuzhe recreated this lost game from childhood memories, with some modifications. If you find any issues or can provide material on Jiujiang Mahjong, contact Q2264033554.",
