    "MIL 2025：136张，皮癞单张杠；必须开口，逐家六番起和。末四张只能自摸或过，七皮、十杠途中结算，轮庄。鸣牌响应为3秒。": "MIL 2025: 136 tiles, with single-tile pi and joker kongs. An open meld is required; the minimum is 6 fan against each opponent. For the final four tiles, only self-draw or pass is allowed. Seven Pi and Ten Kongs settle during play. Dealership rotates. Call responses have a 3-second limit.",
    "阅读 MIL 武汉规则书": "Read the MIL Wuhan rulebook",
    "144张、十三张手牌；可吃碰杠，逐张补花。2花自摸、3花放冲、1花独吊；固定牌型已含胡牌底花。": "144 tiles and 13-tile hands. Chows, pungs, and kongs are allowed; flowers are replaced individually. Self-draw requires 2 flowers, discard wins require 3, and a single-pair wait requires 1. Fixed hand values already include the base flowers for winning.",
