    "双人对战使用 36 张万字牌，20 局交替先手。和牌得 1 分，诈和给对手 1 分，流局双方 0 分。机器人可直接开局，仅真人匹配计入 Elo。": "Play 20 hands with 36 Characters tiles, alternating the first draw. A win scores 1 point, a false win gives your opponent 1 point, and an exhaustive draw scores 0. Play a bot immediately or enter matchmaking for a rated match against another player.",
