    "对战规则": "Match rules",
    "一至九万各四张。共 20 局，双方交替先手。和牌得 1 分，诈和给对手 1 分，流局双方 0 分。总分相同为平局。": "Play 20 hands with four copies of each Characters tile from 1 to 9. The dealer alternates. A win scores 1 point. A false win gives the opponent 1 point. An exhausted wall scores 0. Equal totals draw the match.",
    "可吃、碰、杠，允许七对，无起和番数和振听限制。摸牌或对方出牌时均可宣和，宣和后判定牌形。": "Chow, pung, kong and seven pairs are allowed. There is no minimum fan or furiten restriction. Declare a win on your draw or the opponent’s discard. The hand is checked after the declaration.",
    "摸牌后 10 秒内打牌，响应副露、和牌限时 5 秒。排位计入 Elo，好友房仅计本场比分。": "Discard within 10 seconds of drawing. You have 5 seconds to call or claim a win. Ranked matches count toward Elo. Private rooms track the match score only.",
