    "夺彩麻将，由自恧发起，和雀庄的小伙伴们共同打磨的一款麻将游戏子规则，X计划的开山之作。": "Duocai Mahjong is a Mahjong variant initiated by 自恧 and refined with friends from the mahjong parlor, and the first work of Project X.",
