    "散花天才": "Sanhua Tiancai",
    "十六张手牌，全部字牌及八花补花，开金、抢金、听金坎、一游及二游；动态留墩，最后四张只摸不打。": "16-tile hands; all honors and eight flowers are replaced. Includes revealing gold, robbing gold, gold closed waits, and single and double roaming. The reserved wall varies; the final four tiles are drawn without discarding.",
    "福州麻将规则与平台补则": "Fuzhou Mahjong rules and platform supplements",
    "福州麻将规则书原文": "Original Fuzhou Mahjong rulebook",
    "SPGG 2024：148张，1台起和、5台封顶，花季与动物婚配即时支付；含平台补充约定。": "SPGG 2024: 148 tiles, 1-tai minimum, 5-tai cap, and immediate payment for flower-season and animal pairings. Includes platform supplements.",
    "新加坡 SPGG 平台规则": "Singapore SPGG platform rules",
    "完整规则说明、计分及补充口径。": "Full rules, scoring, and supplementary interpretations.",
    "SPGG 2024 英文原文": "SPGG 2024 English original",
    "Singapore Polytechnic Graduates Guild 发布。": "Published by Singapore Polytechnic Graduates Guild.",
    "九江麻将规则书": "Jiujiang Mahjong rulebook",
    "芋蔗提供的更新版规则书。": "Updated rulebook provided by 芋蔗.",
    "宜兴麻将是江苏宜兴本地的特色玩法，由144张牌组成，其中万条筒各36张，东南西北中发白各4张，花牌8张，2花自摸，3花放冲，一花独吊，最先将手牌全部组成顺子和刻子的玩家赢得一局，起手花牌数能决定你当前牌局打法规划，牌局种类门清，碰碰胡，混一色，清一色等常见大牌，还包括独吊翻倍，杠开翻倍，海底翻倍，抢杠翻3倍等特殊机制，游戏尚在测试阶段，如对本规则感兴趣或有任何建议都可以添加Q541784531一同交流": "Yixing Mahjong is a local game from Yixing, Jiangsu. It uses 144 tiles: 36 each of Characters, Bamboo, and Dots, four each of the seven honors, and eight flowers. Self-draw requires 2 flowers, a discard win 3 flowers, and a single-pair wait 1 flower. The first player to form their hand into chows and pungs wins the hand. The starting flower count informs your strategy. Common high-value hands include Concealed Hand, All Pungs, Half Flush, and Full Flush. Special mechanisms include doubling for a single-pair wait, a kong replacement win, or a last-tile win, and tripling for robbing a kong. The game is still in testing. If interested or if you have suggestions, add Q541784531 to discuss.",
    "宜兴麻将规则书": "Yixing Mahjong rulebook",
