    "福州麻将是一款采用17张和牌机制的地方麻将规则，旨在寻求一种在传统麻将框架内、以开金为核心的做大、抢金、留墩防守三者平衡的博弈游戏，同时试图为三金倒、金龙、游金等特殊和牌提供基于难度和收益的赋分参照；如发现规则漏洞或有任何建议，可在群906497522提交。": "Fuzhou Mahjong is a regional rule set using 17-tile winning hands. Within traditional Mahjong, it seeks a balance among building large hands around revealed gold, robbing gold, and defensive wall reservation. It also aims to score special wins such as Three Gold, Golden Dragon, and Roaming Gold according to difficulty and reward. Report rule loopholes or suggestions in group 906497522.",
