    "136张，报听可选，头跳，32番封顶，另加2底分。未启用地方附录的万能牌等补则。": "136 tiles, optional ready declarations, head-bump, a 32-fan cap, plus 2 base points. Joker rules and other regional-appendix supplements are not enabled.",
    "140张，梅兰竹菊为鬼牌，留手不补花；不吃，不报听，头跳。至少2番，默认同时满足4分起和；自摸翻剩余牌墙前4张奖马，流局退杠分。": "140 tiles. Plum, Orchid, Bamboo, and Chrysanthemum are jokers kept in hand without replacement. No chows or ready declarations; head-bump. At least 2 fan and, by default, at least 4 points are required. A self-draw reveals the first 4 remaining wall tiles as horses; kong points are refunded on a draw.",
    "平鸡自摸禁吃开关必须是布尔值": "The chicken-hand self-draw/no-chow setting must be Boolean",
    "请选择广东麻将子规则": "Select a Guangdong Mahjong variant",
    "4分起和开关必须是布尔值": "The 4-point minimum setting must be Boolean",
    "广东双打每盘八副": "Guangdong doubles uses eight deals per match",
    "战术鸣牌开关必须是布尔值": "The tactical calls setting must be Boolean",
    "MIL 广东推广 2V2 双打": "MIL Guangdong Promotional 2V2 Doubles",
    "仅限门清，每队每副一次": "Concealed hands only, once per team per deal",
    "MIL 2023 花鬼标准本": "MIL 2023 standard flower-joker edition",
    "至少2番，同时至少4分": "At least 2 fan and at least 4 points",
    "梅兰竹菊留手，不补花": "Keep Plum, Orchid, Bamboo, and Chrysanthemum in hand; no replacement",
    "自摸翻前4马，不足不补": "Self-draw reveals the first 4 horses; no replenishment if short",
    "开启（抢断5秒，有机器人时自动关闭）": "On (5-second interruption; automatically disabled with bots)",
    "MIL 2024 无癞子标准本": "MIL 2024 standard no-joker edition",
