    "无效番表牌例：{0}": "Invalid scoring-table example: {0}",
    "无效字牌：{0}": "Invalid honor tile: {0}",
    "无效花牌：{0}": "Invalid flower tile: {0}",
    "国标麻将花混规则是部分国标麻将资深玩家研发的娱乐玩法。该娱乐规则将麻将花牌中“春、夏、秋、冬”四朵红花取出用作赖子（花混），并相应提高了有赖子手牌的和番限制以及无赖子和牌时的分数奖励。该玩法进一步加快了牌局行进速度，突出了“抢和”理念，丰富了手牌策略变化，可以作为国标麻将竞技规则以外的一种娱乐补充。": "MCR Flower Jokers is a recreational variant developed by experienced MCR players. The four red season tiles—Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter—serve as jokers. Winning requirements increase for hands with jokers, while joker-free wins receive extra points. This speeds up play, emphasizes racing to win, and adds strategic variety as a recreational supplement to competitive MCR.",
    "①起和限制，0赖子和1赖子8番起和，2赖子16番起和，3赖子32番起和，4赖子64番起和。": "① Winning minimum: 8 fan with 0 or 1 joker, 16 with 2, 32 with 3, and 64 with 4.",
    "②无赖子和牌时结算时番数额外加八番或者直接番数翻倍（默认额外加八番）": "② A joker-free win gains 8 extra fan or doubles its fan at settlement (default: 8 extra fan).",
    "③赖子只能在摸到手的时候摸切，不准手切，他家点出的癞子无法点和和牌（起手赖子不得打出）": "③ Jokers may only be discarded immediately when drawn, never from the hand. Discarded jokers cannot be claimed for a win (starting jokers cannot be discarded).",
    "④手中摸到四个赖子可以花杠，和牌时剩下手牌必须符合基本和牌型，花杠算88番。": "④ Four jokers in hand may form a flower kong. At the win, the remaining hand must form a basic winning shape. The flower kong scores 88 fan.",
    "⑤（四朵红花用作赖子的情况下）补的黑花在结算时一朵算4番，两朵8番，三朵16番，四朵32番": "⑤ When the four red flowers are jokers, replaced black flowers score 4/8/16/32 fan for 1/2/3/4 flowers.",
    "⑥四朵红花是春夏秋冬，四朵黑花是梅兰竹菊，自摸/点和癞子不算绝张，癞子能构成独听条件时构成独听（设置默认关闭癞子多面听）": "⑥ Red flowers are Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter; black flowers are Plum, Orchid, Bamboo, and Chrysanthemum. Winning on a joker by draw or discard does not count as Last Tile. A joker can qualify for a single wait when it creates one (joker multiple waits are off by default).",
    "黑花1朵": "1 black flower",
    "黑花2朵": "2 black flowers",
    "黑花3朵": "3 black flowers",
    "黑花4朵": "4 black flowers",
