    "MIL 杭州麻将（推广）2025：136张，白板财神，十三张手牌，仅自摸；爆头、财飘、七对、十风，4番封顶，老庄2/4/8倍，三吃承包，墙尾20张流局。": "MIL Hangzhou Mahjong (Promotional), 2025: 136 tiles, White Dragon jokers, 13-tile hands, self-draw only. Explosive Pair, Joker Float, Seven Pairs, and Ten Winds; 4-fan cap, dealer streak multipliers 2/4/8, liability after three chows, and a draw with 20 wall tiles left.",
