    "主种子格式错误：仅支持十进制或十六进制": "Invalid master seed format: only decimal or hexadecimal is supported",
    "上饶麻将是流行于江西上饶及周边的玩法，使用136张麻将牌（无花牌），只能自摸。除了基本的屁和牌型，还有碰碰胡、七对、九幺和十三烂特色牌型。宝牌（即“癞子”）为核心特色，单宝仅可作将，多余宝才能作万能牌，打出宝牌（“飞宝”）和牌可翻倍，因此又称为“飞宝麻将”。特色牌型和翻倍机制配合只能自摸的规则，使牌局兼具趣味性和策略性。": "Shangrao Mahjong is played in and around Shangrao, Jiangxi, with 136 tiles and no flowers; wins are by self-draw only. Besides the basic hand, it includes All Pungs, Seven Pairs, Terminals and Honors, and Thirteen Unconnected. Treasure tiles (jokers) are central: a single treasure may only form the pair, while additional treasures may act as wildcards. Discarding treasure (Flying Treasure) can double a win, hence the name Flying Treasure Mahjong. These hands and multipliers, combined with self-draw-only play, create an entertaining and strategic game.",
    "飞宝七星": "Flying Treasure Seven Stars",
    "请选择上饶麻将标准规则": "Select standard Shangrao Mahjong rules",
    "副数组": "Deal groups",
    "房间名不能超过128字": "Room name cannot exceed 128 characters",
    "无效设置：{0}": "Invalid setting: {0}",
    "无效开关：{0}": "Invalid toggle: {0}",
    "MIL 沈阳麻将（推广）2025：136张，须有刻子或将牌为中发白、有幺九、齐三门或纯一色；七对例外。喜杠、旋风杠和杠后公示，六番封顶，最后四张分张自摸。": "MIL Shenyang Mahjong (Promotional), 2025: 136 tiles. Requires a pung or a Dragon pair, terminals or honors, and all three suits or one pure suit; Seven Pairs is an exception. Happiness and Whirlwind kongs, post-kong reveals, a 6-fan cap, and separate self-draws for the final four tiles.",
    "沈阳麻将仅支持 MIL 2025": "Shenyang Mahjong supports only MIL 2025",
    "训练牌山：直接输入随机种子或随机生成随机种子，允许观战，不使用复式密钥": "Training wall: enter or generate a random seed. Spectating is allowed; no duplicate key is used.",
    "密钥牌山：自动生成随机种子生成牌墙，构建后的手牌在首次使用时，玩家和密钥创建者均不可知": "Key wall: generate a random seed automatically to build the wall. On first use, neither players nor the key creator know the prepared hands.",
    "复现牌山：使用已经确定的随机种子构建手牌和牌山，密钥创建者了解牌山的具体内容": "Recreated wall: build hands and walls from a fixed random seed. The key creator knows the wall's contents.",
    "手动牌山：使用手动设牌构建的牌山，密钥创建者了解牌山的具体内容，一般复原线下对局时使用": "Manual wall: build the wall from manually set tiles. The key creator knows its contents; usually used to recreate offline games.",
