    "审核说明": "Review notes",
    "上传格式 上传一个 .zip，直接放一套按牌面代号命名的 PNG 和一个 tiles.cfg。2D 手牌与 3D 牌面共用这套原图。 PNG 保留原始比例及透明通道，不拉伸、不二次压缩。可在 tiles.cfg 分别设置 2D、3D 的整包默认位置和缩放，以及每张牌的微调。 牌面代号：万子 11-19、筒子 21-29、索子 31-39、东南西北 41-44、中白发 45-47、春夏秋冬梅兰竹菊 51-58、通用花牌 59；红五万/筒/索为 105/205/305，纯白白板为 2。 其他须知： 1. PNG 单边不超过 4096 像素，牌面单张不超过 4MB，背景和牌背单张不超过 8MB，压缩包及解压后总大小不超过 128MB；缺失牌面使用官方牌面递补。 2. 配置使用 UTF-8，支持 # 整行或行末注释。[2d]、[3d] 设置整包默认值，[2d.11]、[3d.11] 设置单牌相对调整；x/y 是位置百分比（-100～100），scale 是缩放百分比（25～200）。未配置时位置 0、缩放 100；单牌设置叠加在整包设置上。 3. 压缩包内容示例（不需要其他文件）： NewCardFace.zip ├── 11.png ├── 12.png ├── 105.png └── tiles.cfg # tiles.cfg 示例 [2d] x = 0 y = 0 scale = 100 [3d] scale = 100 [2d.11] y = 2 # 一万向上移动 2% [3d.11] scale = 95 也可直接上传 Unity「牌面设计 / 卡牌设计」导出的完整牌包，保留背景、牌背、颜色和全部微调。": "Upload format\n\nUpload a .zip containing a set of PNGs named by tile codes and one tiles.cfg. 2D hand tiles and 3D tile faces share these original images.\n\nPNGs retain their original aspect ratio and alpha channel, without stretching or recompression. Use tiles.cfg to set separate default positions and scales for 2D and 3D, plus per-tile adjustments.\n\nTile codes: Characters 11-19, Dots 21-29, Bamboo 31-39, East/South/West/North 41-44, Red/White/Green Dragons 45-47, Spring/Summer/Autumn/Winter/Plum/Orchid/Bamboo/Chrysanthemum 51-58, generic flower 59; red fives of Characters/Dots/Bamboo are 105/205/305; a plain White Dragon is 2.\n\nOther notes:\n\n1. PNG sides must not exceed 4096 pixels. Each tile face is limited to 4MB, each background or back to 8MB, and both the archive and its extracted total to 128MB. Missing tiles fall back to official designs.\n\n2. Configuration uses UTF-8 and supports # comments on whole lines or at line ends. [2d] and [3d] set package defaults; [2d.11] and [3d.11] set relative per-tile adjustments. x/y are position percentages (-100–100); scale is a percentage (25–200). Defaults are position 0 and scale 100. Per-tile settings are added to package settings.\n\n3. Example archive contents (no other files needed):\nNewCardFace.zip\n├── 11.png\n├── 12.png\n├── 105.png\n└── tiles.cfg\n\n# tiles.cfg example\n[2d]\nx = 0\ny = 0\nscale = 100\n[3d]\nscale = 100\n[2d.11]\ny = 2 # Move One Character up 2%\n[3d.11]\nscale = 95\n\nYou can also upload a complete tile package exported from Unity's Tile Face Design / Tile Design, preserving backgrounds, backs, colors, and all adjustments.",
    "请选择 zip 文件": "Choose a ZIP file",
