    "国标巡目按庄家巡计算，与对局进程一致。顺位按牌谱得分独立计算，允许同分同排位。": "MCR turns are counted by the dealer's turns, matching game progression. Placements are calculated independently from replay scores, with tied scores sharing a place.",
    "以下统计仅覆盖当前筛选内已下载的牌谱。条件比率使用对应的立直、副露或和牌样本；无样本时显示“—”。各指标可查看计算口径。": "These statistics cover only downloaded replays matching the current filter. Conditional rates use the corresponding riichi, meld, or winning samples; “—” indicates no samples. Each metric provides its calculation definition.",
