    "位）": ")",
    "座位即牌谱中的 p0-p3；东（p0）为第 1 局庄家。每局发牌按 p0→p3 各 13 张依次从牌山头部抓取": "Seats correspond to p0–p3 in the replay; East (p0) deals the 1st hand. Each hand deals 13 tiles per player from the front of the wall, in order p0→p3.",
