    "不启用卡牌轮转": "Disable tile rotation",
    "两副牌交替作为3D卡牌": "Alternate two tile sets for 3D tiles",
    "第一局默认使用第一副牌，随后每小局随机选择手牌，随机选择的手牌必定不与上一局重复，选择的卡牌预设越多，内存开销则越大": "The first hand uses the first tile set by default. Each subsequent hand randomly selects a set different from the previous hand. Selecting more tile presets uses more memory.",
