    "”吗？\n该预设将退出轮转；两副轮转不足两副时会关闭轮转。\n已上传的图片会保留。": "”?\nThis preset will be removed from rotation. Two-set rotation turns off if fewer than two sets remain.\nUploaded images will be kept.",
