    "背面边缘调色": "Back edge color",
    "手牌牌面背景：显示在 2D 手牌牌面下方。经典 272×389，新版修长底图 272×424；其他尺寸按原图比例显示。\n": "Hand tile-face background: displayed beneath 2D hand tile faces. Classic size 272×389, new elongated background 272×424; other sizes retain their original aspect ratio.\n\n",
    "手牌牌背：显示 2D 暗面图样（例如里宝牌未翻开），不是 3D 牌背。\n": "Hand tile back: the back pattern of 2D tiles (such as unrevealed ura-dora), not the 3D tile back.\n\n",
    "单独上传：点击对应标签下的上传按钮，分别选择 hand-bg.png 或 hand-back.png。\n": "Upload separately: use the upload button under each tab to select hand-bg.png or hand-back.png.\n\n",
    "也可一次上传 zip，文件夹示例：\n": "You can also upload a zip in one go. Folder example:\n\n",
    "透明花纹牌面请在「牌面」页打开「使用牌面背景」，整张牌面请关闭。\n": "For transparent-pattern tile faces, turn on “Use tile background” on the “Tile Faces” page; turn it off for full tile-face images.\n\n",
    "背景与牌背默认使用靛蓝，经典位于列表末尾。支持多份上传，确认名称后保存；下拉切换，使用“改名”“删除”管理。返回不保存，恢复默认不删除图库。\n": "Backgrounds and tile backs default to indigo; Classic is at the end of the list. Multiple uploads are supported. Confirm a name to save, switch with the dropdown, and manage with “Rename” and “Delete”. Back discards changes; restoring defaults does not delete the image library.\n\n",
    "ZIP 导入只需确认一次名称，默认为 ZIP 文件名，背景与牌背使用同一名称；同类素材不能重名。\n": "ZIP import requires confirming a name only once, defaulting to the ZIP filename. The background and tile back share the name; assets of the same type cannot have duplicate names.\n\n",
    "2D手牌牌背标题栏的“自动同步手牌背景”默认开启，切换背景会使用同名牌背；没有同名牌背时保留当前牌背。手动选牌背会关闭同步。\n": "“Auto-sync hand background” in the 2D hand tile-back header is on by default. Switching backgrounds selects the tile back with the same name; if none exists, the current tile back stays. Selecting a tile back manually turns sync off.\n\n",
    "手牌背景右上角“牌面位置”可调整花纹的水平、垂直位置和等比缩放；每个背景独立保存，返回撤销，确认保存。\n": "“Tile-face position” at the top right of the hand background adjusts the pattern's horizontal and vertical position and proportional scale. Settings are saved separately for each background; Back cancels, Confirm saves.\n\n",
    "3D 牌面背景只用于 3D 卡牌正面，不是手牌背景。\n": "3D tile-face backgrounds apply only to the front of 3D tiles, not to hand backgrounds.\n\n",
    "请到「3D 卡牌设计」中的「3D牌面背景」标签设置背景和纯色，3D 牌背请到「牌背」标签设置。": "Set backgrounds and solid colors under “3D Tile-Face Background” in “3D Tile Design”. Set 3D tile backs under “Tile Back”.",
    "选择手牌牌面背景": "Select hand tile-face background",
    "选择手牌牌背": "Select hand tile back",
