    "导入手牌背景与牌背": "Import hand background and tile back",
    "已保存并选中“": "Saved and selected “",
    "图片已保存，请从列表中选择": "Image saved. Select it from the list.",
    "重命名手牌牌背": "Rename hand tile back",
    "重命名手牌背景": "Rename hand background",
    "删除手牌牌背": "Delete hand tile back",
    "删除手牌背景": "Delete hand background",
    "”吗？\n正在使用时将恢复默认靛蓝，其他上传图片不受影响。": "”?\nIf in use, it will revert to the default indigo. Other uploaded images are unaffected.",
    "已删除“": "Deleted “",
    "上传格式（仅标准麻将）\n": "Upload format (standard Mahjong only)\n\n",
    "ZIP 内只需放一套以牌号命名的 PNG，2D 手牌与 3D 自动共用。\n": "The ZIP only needs one set of PNGs named by tile number, automatically shared by 2D hands and 3D.\n\n",
    "包内只需牌号 PNG 和一个 tiles.cfg；不需要 manifest.json 或预览图。\n\n": "The package only needs tile-number PNGs and one tiles.cfg; no manifest.json or preview image is required.\n\n\n",
    "推荐透明底原图；经典手牌背景为 272×389，新版为 272×424，花纹保持原图比例。\n": "Transparent originals are recommended. Classic hand backgrounds are 272×389 and new ones 272×424; patterns retain their original aspect ratio.\n\n",
    "tiles.cfg 支持 # 注释：[2d] / [3d] 设置整包默认值，[2d.11] / [3d.11] 设置单牌相对微调，参数 x、y、scale 使用百分比。\n": "tiles.cfg supports # comments. [2d] / [3d] set package defaults; [2d.11] / [3d.11] set relative per-tile adjustments. x, y, and scale use percentages.\n\n",
    "上传和导出保留原图。游戏加载牌面时，最长边超过 512 像素的图片会等比缩小至 512 像素，小图保持原尺寸。透明区域保留，牌面居中显示，空余部分由背景或底色补齐。\n\n": "Uploads and exports preserve originals. When loading tile faces, images with a longest side over 512 pixels are scaled proportionally to 512 pixels; smaller images retain their size. Transparency is preserved, faces are centered, and empty space is filled by the background or base color.\n\n\n",
    "牌号：万11–19、筒21–29、索31–39、字41–47、花51–58；赤宝105/205/305，纯白白板2。\n": "Tile numbers: characters 11–19, dots 21–29, bamboo 31–39, honors 41–47, flowers 51–58; red fives 105/205/305, plain white dragon 2.\n\n",
    "使用 PNG。资源上限：单边≤4096、牌面单张≤4MiB、背景和牌背单张≤8MiB、压缩包及解压后≤128MiB。可缺少部分牌面，缺图回退官方。\n": "Use PNG. Asset limits: each side ≤4096, each tile face ≤4MiB, each background or tile back ≤8MiB, archive and extracted total ≤128MiB. Some faces may be omitted; missing images fall back to official ones.\n\n",
    "虹雀牌组固定使用官方 HQv3.1。\n": "Hongque tile sets always use official HQv3.1.\n\n",
    "PNG 可直接放在 ZIP 根目录，也可放在文件夹中。\n\n": "PNGs may be placed directly in the ZIP root or inside a folder.\n\n\n",
    "示例：11.png、12.png、21.png……与 tiles.cfg；默认 x=0、y=0、scale=100，缩放范围 25–200。\n": "Example: 11.png, 12.png, 21.png… and tiles.cfg. Defaults: x=0, y=0, scale=100; scale range 25–200.\n\n",
    "上传后输入名称并确认保存；可保留多套，点击对应牌面包按钮切换，选中后可重命名或删除。返回不保存。\n": "After uploading, enter a name and confirm to save. Multiple sets can be kept; click a tile-pack button to switch, and rename or delete the selected set. Back discards changes.\n\n",
    "透明花纹可叠加牌面背景；选择“背景铺满”时保留铺满显示。\n": "Transparent patterns can overlay tile backgrounds. Selecting “Fill background” keeps the full-fill display.\n\n",
    "手牌背景与牌背在对应标签管理；3D 牌面背景请到「卡牌设计」中的「3D牌面背景」分区设置。": "Manage hand backgrounds and tile backs in their tabs. Set 3D tile-face backgrounds in the “3D Tile-Face Background” section of “Tile Design”.",
