    "MIL《广东麻将（推广）竞赛规则（试行2023版）》：140张，梅兰竹菊为鬼牌，留手不补花；不吃、不报听，头跳。至少2番，默认同时满足4分起和；自摸翻剩余牌墙前4马，不足不补，流局退杠分。平台补则：无鬼×2与每张出鬼×2连续相乘，出2鬼且无鬼为×8。": "MIL Guangdong Mahjong (Promotional) Competition Rules, trial 2023 edition: 140 tiles. Plum, Orchid, Bamboo and Chrysanthemum are jokers kept in hand, not replaced. No chows or ready declarations; head bump. At least 2 fan, with a simultaneous 4-point minimum by default. Self-draw reveals the first four remaining wall tiles as horses, without filling a shortfall; kong points are refunded on a draw. Platform supplement: the no-joker ×2 and each discarded joker's ×2 multiply successively; discarding two jokers and having none gives ×8.",
