    "十六": "16",
    "传统84张马来西亚三人麻将：筒子、字牌、16花与4飞。东南西三席，5番起和，可吃碰杠，飞可作百搭或当花。输家花分、飞牌分与即时杠花分分别结算；默认满番不叠加。规则依据 Cheah / Sloper 定型文，细节见平台规则书。": "Traditional 84-tile Malaysian three-player Mahjong: Dots, honors, 16 flowers and four Fei. East, South and West seats; 5-fan minimum. Chow, pung and kong are allowed. Fei may be jokers or flowers. Losing players' flower points, Fei points and immediate kong/flower points are settled separately. Limit hands do not stack by default. Based on the Cheah / Sloper formulation; see the platform rulebook for details.",
    "MIL《南昌麻将（推广）竞赛规则（试行2026版）》四人单打：136张，翻正副精，精牌可作任意牌；可吃数牌、三种风牌或中发白。支持十三烂、七对、精吊、德国、德中德及冲关、霸王精。1番起和、6番封顶，精分、杠分、和牌分分别结算，流局也结算精分和杠分。": "MIL Nanchang Mahjong (Promotional) Competition Rules, trial 2026 edition, four-player singles: 136 tiles. Reveal primary and secondary Jing, which may substitute for any tile. Chows may use number tiles, three different winds, or all three dragons. Supports Thirteen Unconnected, Seven Pairs, Jing Single Wait, German, German within German, Chongguan and Overlord Jing. 1-fan minimum, 6-fan cap. Jing, kong and win points are settled separately; Jing and kong points are also settled on drawn hands.",
    "MIL 南京麻将（推广）2024：144张，中发白及八花须补花；不吃牌，四花或非偶然番起和，底分10分、120分封顶，轮庄，含花杠、跟牌、承包和外包。": "MIL Nanjing Mahjong (Promotional) 2024: 144 tiles. Dragons and eight flowers require replacement. No chows. Four flowers or a non-incidental fan are required to win. Base score 10, cap 120; rotating dealer. Includes flower kongs, following discards, liability and outsourced liability.",
