    "报听后仅自摸 基本分 {0}分": "Self-draw only after ready declaration · Base {0} points",
    "MIL《山西麻将（推广）竞赛规则（试行2023版）》：136张、十三张手牌，不吃牌、无花无癞子；暗扣一张牌报听，三点可自摸、六点可点和。和牌时结算全桌杠账，未报听放铳须包全桌。线上使用房间配置，默认每局额外思考局时20秒、每次步时5秒，先用步时再扣局时；原书线下3秒报牌时限不另设线上上限。零局时只用步时，重连不重开窗口。": "MIL Shanxi Mahjong (Promotional) Competition Rules, trial 2023 edition: 136 tiles, 13-tile hands, no chows, flowers or jokers. Declare ready with a face-down discard; self-draw requires 3 points and discard wins 6. All kong accounts are settled on a win. A discarder who has not declared ready pays for the whole table. Online play uses room timers: by default 20 seconds of extra thinking time per hand and 5 seconds per action, using action time before hand time. The rulebook's offline 3-second call limit adds no separate online limit. With zero hand time, only action time is used; reconnecting does not restart the response window.",
    "分张：只和不打": "Final tiles: wins only, no discards",
    "选择是否公示过蛋": "Choose whether to reveal the egg passage",
    "长毛": "Long Hair",
    "\n顺和：仅自摸或更高番点和": "\nPassed win: self-draw or a higher-fan discard win only",
    "\n过蛋：": "\nEgg passage: ",
    "136张、十三张手牌，无花无癞子。先碰或明杠开门才能吃，闭门可报听；基本和须有幺九、刻杠或箭牌将，并具三门或清一色，七对不限。喜杠不补牌，旋风杠补牌；杠后补牌公示筒子过蛋每家5分，一条每家10分。末四张只和不打，6番封顶，和者坐庄。线上使用房间局时与步时。": "136 tiles and 13-tile hands, no flowers or jokers. A pung or exposed kong is required before chowing; a concealed hand may declare ready. An ordinary win needs terminals or honors, a pung/kong or dragon pair, and all three suits or a full flush; Seven Pairs is exempt. Happy Kongs draw no replacement; Whirlwind Kongs do. After a kong replacement, revealing a Dot egg passage scores 5 from each player; One Bamboo scores 10 each. The last four tiles allow wins but no discards. Cap 6 fan; the winner becomes dealer. Online play uses room hand and action timers.",
