    "八人房间，左闭室、右开室；选择座位后可添加机器人，满八席后由房主开始。训练牌山直接使用随机种子；其他牌山使用密钥，副数跟随已有密钥。": "Eight-player room, closed room on the left and open room on the right. Choose seats to add bots; the host starts when all eight seats are filled. Training walls use random seeds directly. Other walls use keys, with the deal count taken from the existing key.",
    "选手": "Player",
    "查叫 / 退税": "Ready-hand check / Kong refund",
    "退税": "Kong refund",
    "川麻复式密钥仅支持双打复式子规则": "Sichuan duplicate keys support doubles duplicate subrules only",
    "复式双打请选择自动生成或输入已有密钥": "For doubles duplicate, generate a key automatically or enter an existing one",
    "请输入所选牌山类型的复式密钥": "Enter a duplicate key for the selected wall type",
    "需缺门": "Must void a suit",
    "点和{0}番\n自摸{1}番": "Discard win: {0} fan\nSelf-draw: {1} fan",
    "新加坡四人麻将：依 SPGG 2024 年规则，13 张手牌、148 张牌（含花季与猫鼠鸡蜈蚣）、1 台起和、5 台封顶。花季婚配与杠即时支付，400 分起分；庄和连庄，流局无杠连庄。完整口径见规则书。": "Singapore four-player Mahjong under SPGG 2024 rules: 13-tile hands, 148 tiles including flowers, seasons, Cat, Mouse, Rooster and Centipede. Minimum 1 tai, cap 5 tai. Flower/season matches and kongs pay immediately. Starting score 400. The dealer repeats on a win, or on a draw with no kongs. See the rulebook for the full definitions.",
    "连庄拉庄": "Dealer repeats and la-zhuang",
    "仅自摸\n{0}番{1}分": "Self-draw only\n{0} fan, {1} points",
    "广东双打": "Guangdong doubles",
    "MIL《推倒和麻将（推广）竞赛规则（试行2024版）》：136张、十三张手牌，无花无癞子。可以吃碰杠，报听可选，头跳；番数相加32封顶，另加2底分，自摸三家付，点和一家付双份。杠分即时结算。战术鸣牌默认开启，有机器人时关闭；普通询问按房间步时加剩余局时，抢断再问独立5秒，允许升级申请。": "MIL Tuidaohu Mahjong (Promotional) Competition Rules, trial 2024 edition: 136 tiles, 13-tile hands, no flowers or jokers. Chow, pung and kong are allowed; ready declaration is optional; head bump. Additive fan capped at 32, plus 2 base points. Self-draw is paid by all three opponents; a discarder pays double alone. Kong points settle immediately. Tactical calls are on by default, off with bots. Normal prompts use the room's action time plus remaining hand time; intercepted calls get a separate 5-second response, and upgraded requests are allowed.",
    "弹鬼": "Bounce joker",
    "How to Play Vietnamese Mahjong · Bridget Young 2026 修订扩展版。四人经典规则，含鬼牌、弹鬼、包付与累进计分。": "How to Play Vietnamese Mahjong · Bridget Young's revised and expanded 2026 edition. Classic four-player rules with jokers, joker bouncing, liability payments and progressive scoring.",
