    "过水或未成和": "Passed win or incomplete hand",
    "MIL《武汉麻将（推广）竞赛规则（试行2025版）》：136张，开牌后翻癞子，皮子与癞子可单张杠出并选择补牌或过。必须开口，普通和牌须258将及实体胚子；两张及以上癞子只能大和。大和首项3番、叠加每项1番。逐家6番起和、10番封顶，全满为金顶。末四张只能自摸或过；七皮、十杠途中结算，轮庄。": "MIL Wuhan Mahjong (Promotional) Competition Rules, trial 2025 edition: 136 tiles. Reveal the joker after dealing. Pi and joker tiles can be declared as single-tile kongs, with replacement or pass chosen. An open meld is required. Ordinary wins need a 2/5/8 pair and a natural partial set; two or more jokers allow big wins only. The first big-win element gives 3 fan, each extra element 1. Minimum 6 fan against each opponent, cap 10; reaching the cap against all is Golden Summit. The last four tiles allow self-draw or pass only. Seven Pi and Ten Kongs settle during play; rotating dealer.",
    "金顶": "Golden Summit",
    "主3番\n叠1番": "First: 3 fan\nEach extra: 1 fan",
