    "摸海底": "Draw the last tile",
    "南雀规则由南瓜饼编写，采用简化的中庸计分法，无起和限制。默认血战到底，和牌者退场，三家和牌或牌墙耗尽后统一结算。": "Nanque rules by Nangua Bing use simplified Zhongyong scoring with no winning minimum. Blood Battle is the default: winners leave play, and settlement occurs when three players have won or the wall is exhausted.",
    "无和牌": "No winning hand",
    "\n自摸{0}分": "\nSelf-draw: {0} points",
    "海底漫游": "Last Tile Roaming",
    "连对": "Consecutive Pairs",
    "同对": "Matching Pairs",
    "金锣赛是一种制作国标麻将高难度番种的特殊比赛规则，将七对、番数低于等于24且不是凑番的和牌判作错和，从而有充分的时间制作平常对局较为稀有的凑番或者大牌的玩法，其中对某些具体番种有特殊的规定，具体规则可见jmcr.cc.cd，推荐添加q群1101569363游玩。": "Golden Gong is a special format for building difficult MCR scoring patterns. Seven Pairs and wins worth 24 fan or less that are not built by combining scoring elements are treated as false wins. This gives time to build combinations or large hands rarely seen in ordinary play. Some scoring patterns have specific provisions. See jmcr.cc.cd for the rules; QQ group 1101569363 is recommended for finding games.",
